# The three step system prompts are deliberately NOT tracked here. This
# repository is public and the prompts are product logic, so their source of
# truth is the private BuildShip workflow `service-runpipeline-THIN`, where
# ARCHITECT_SYSTEM / GENERATOR_SYSTEM / REVIEW_SYSTEM are node inputs. The .txt
# copies in this directory are local working files only and may lag the
# workflow. This is the intended arrangement - not an oversight to be corrected.
BUILDSHIP_ARCHITECT_SYSTEM_PROMPT_UPDATED.txt
BUILDSHIP_GENERATOR_SYSTEM_PROMPT_UPDATED.txt
BUILDSHIP_REVIEW_SYSTEM_PROMPT.txt
BUILDSHIP_REVIEW_SYSTEM_PROMPT_UPDATED.txt
